flowchart TD
    User([User natural-language query<br/>e.g. 'melancholy acoustic for a rainy night']) --> G1

    G1{{"<b>Guardrail 1</b>: Input Validation<br/>rejects empty, too long,<br/>prompt-injection patterns"}}
    G1 -->|rejected| Refuse1([Refusal message<br/>returned to user])
    G1 -->|passed| Parser

    Parser["<b>Intent Parser</b><br/>src/intent_parser.py<br/>Gemini extracts structured user_prefs<br/>keyword fallback if LLM offline"]
    Parser --> G2

    G2{{"<b>Guardrail 2</b>: Parsed Prefs Validation<br/>type checks + range checks<br/>on target_energy, likes_acoustic"}}
    G2 -->|invalid| DefaultPrefs["Neutral default prefs<br/>pipeline continues"]
    G2 -->|passed| Retriever
    DefaultPrefs --> Retriever

    Retriever["<b>Semantic Retriever</b><br/>src/retriever.py<br/>sentence-transformers embeds<br/>song docs + genre/mood glossary<br/>cosine similarity → top-15 candidates"]

    Corpus[("<b>Multi-source corpus</b><br/>data/songs.csv (52 songs)<br/>+ genre_gloss + mood_gloss")]
    Corpus -.embeddings.-> Retriever

    Retriever --> Scorer

    Scorer["<b>Structured Scorer</b><br/>src/recommender.py<br/>score_song weighted formula<br/>+ optional artist-penalty diversity<br/>picks top-5 from 15 candidates"]

    Scorer --> LLM

    LLM["<b>LLM Commentary (v1 draft)</b><br/>src/llm_client.py<br/>gemini-3.6-flash primary<br/>gemini-3.5-flash-lite fallback<br/>offline template if both fail"]

    Critic["<b>Self-Critique (Agentic Workflow)</b><br/>src/rag_pipeline.py<br/>Gemini reviews v1 vs picks<br/>returns JSON: on_topic, grounded, concerns"]

    Decision{{"<b>Accept or revise?</b><br/>branch on critic's JSON verdict"}}

    Reviser["<b>Reviser (Agentic Workflow)</b><br/>src/rag_pipeline.py<br/>rewrites addressing concerns<br/>output becomes v2 commentary"]

    LLM --> Critic
    Critic --> Decision
    Decision -->|on_topic=T, grounded=T, concerns=empty| G3
    Decision -->|any flag raised| Reviser
    Reviser --> G3

    G3{{"<b>Guardrail 3</b>: Grounding Verification<br/>src/guardrails.py<br/>flags quoted titles not in top-k<br/>distinguishes hallucination vs off-prompt"}}

    G3 --> Output([Final response<br/>top-5 picks + reasons<br/>+ grounded commentary<br/>+ full trace of every stage])

    Eval["<b>Evaluation Harness</b><br/>scripts/run_eval.py<br/>8 predefined queries<br/>per-query pass/fail criteria"]
    Tests["<b>Pytest Suite</b><br/>tests/test_recommender.py<br/>20 tests: exact math,<br/>edge cases, guardrails"]

    Eval -.tests.-> Parser
    Eval -.tests.-> Scorer
    Eval -.tests.-> G3
    Tests -.tests.-> Scorer
    Tests -.tests.-> G1
    Tests -.tests.-> G3

    classDef guardrail fill:#fee,stroke:#c33,stroke-width:2px
    classDef llm fill:#eef,stroke:#33c,stroke-width:2px
    classDef test fill:#efe,stroke:#3c3,stroke-width:2px
    classDef data fill:#ffd,stroke:#c93,stroke-width:2px

    class G1,G2,G3 guardrail
    class Parser,LLM,Critic,Reviser llm
    class Decision guardrail
    class Eval,Tests test
    class Corpus data
